，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Those who come to pray these days ask for longer days and quiet nights. I tell them what the Church teaches: suffering brings us closer to God.","zh":"近来来祷告的人，求的多是白昼长些、夜里平安。我便照教会的教导告诉他们：苦难使人接近神。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"Morning prayers are just over. If you want holy water, you will have to wait for the deacon; he has the key.","zh":"晨祷刚做完。你若要领圣水，得等执事回来，钥匙在他身上。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The snow on the heights is late melting this year. The sheep still can't get up to the high pasture, so they're on hay.","zh":"山上的雪今年化得晚，羊到现在还上不了高处的草场，只能喂干草。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water","id":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk1","type":"actor/person/traveler","name":{"en":"Bernard Rosewell","zh":"伯纳德·玫瑰井"},"place":{"on":"tile","map":"altar.martyrheath-shrine","x":11,"y":12},"facing":"down","props":{"age":20,"household":"altar.martyrheath-shrine.h0","purse":5,"favourite":"item/food/berries"},"contents":["altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk1.coin0","altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk1.coin1","altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk1.coin2","altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk1.coin3","altar.martyrheath-shrine.folk1.coin4"],"look":{"bod